.TH ACTION_PRESSED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
action_pressed \- True only on the frame any key or pad button bound to the action went down
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqactions.h\(dq
.BI "bool action_pressed(const ActionMap *m, const Input *in, int a);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True only on the frame any key or pad button bound to the action went down. Axes are not considered (a stick has no "press" edge). The action\-level equivalent of key_pressed().
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on the press frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/actions.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR action_down (3),
.BR key_pressed (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
